    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Barcelona-based photographer, filmmaker and art director (b. 1989), self-taught. Broke out art-directing Solange A Seat at the Table and When I Get Home (Cranes in the Sky, Dont Touch My Hair) and a Tate Modern performance; since then Dior, Givenchy, Mugler, Helmut Lang, Vogue, The New Yorker, and artists Rosalia, Arca, Rupi Kaur. Known for spiritual, light-soaked imagery of the female body. Highly senior, internationally recognised artist (~12+ yrs). Autonomy 5: directs her own vision end to end, agency-represented (We Folk). Freelance per her self-maintained site and IG. She also art-directs (Creative direction may fit, see Open Question). LinkedIn found: es.linkedin.com/in/carlota-guerrero-088947b4 (Google snippet: Photographer and creative director). No personal public email; booking via olivia@wefolk.com (agency). IG context shot queued (state/ig-queue.json): Instagram blocked headless Playwright at scrape time.",
